ense we all tied  them up and put them back in boxes and  we did it again but we all helped  because there were thousands of letters  freddy stroma said that one of his most  memorable days on set  happened while filming a quidditch scene  in the half-blood prince when  he accidentally hit a costume designer  in the head with a quaffle  why are you wearing glasses uh um  reading reading  josh herdman has said that the scene he  remembers the most fondly  is the polyjuice potion scene from  chamber of secrets  he claimed that the producers required  extensive rehearsal time and even made  him sit down and re-watch the first film  in order to capture daniel radcliffe's  likeness  the harry potter cast clearly treasures  their memories from filming  and who wouldn't getting to be a part of  one of the biggest film franchises of  all time  is quite the accomplishment from walking  on set for the first time  to playing guitar with gary oldman or  even scaring the son of the script  supervisor  these were just some of the cast's  highlights which moment in the harry  potter films is your favorite
 

